B.akd=new A.mR("How do I change my password?","Navigate to Settings \u2192 Change Password. Enter your current password, then set a new password of at least 6 characters.")
B.ak3=new A.mR("How do I manage my service providers?","In the dashboard, navigate to the Providers section. You can invite, view, and manage all service providers assigned to your business.")
